@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
title Design — Existing author policy and provenance
left to right direction
class author_policy {
  + locked(courseid)
  + save(courseid, policy)
  + require_native_copy(file, sourcecourse, targetcourse)
  + capture(file)
}
class "local_multipicker_coursepolicy" as Policy <<record>>
class "local_multipicker_attribution" as Attribution <<record>>
class "local_multipicker_origin" as Origin <<record>>
author_policy --> Policy
author_policy --> Attribution
Attribution "1" -- "0..*" Origin
Policy -[hidden]down-> Attribution
note bottom of author_policy
Initial declarations are captured.
Any effective lock refuses native copying.
end note
@enduml
